      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: Identify the type of probability distribution involved. This scenario follows a binomial distribution because there are two possible outcomes (treasure or no treasure) for each island, and we are interested in the probability of a specific number of successes (finding treasure) out of a fixed number of trials (visiting islands).",
