      "feature_source": "stage2_saved_hidden_states[19]",
      "near_end": false,
      "prefix_token_count": 287,
      "q": 0.055665187159151856,
      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: Substitute the values into the formula. Here, $n = 7$, $k = 4$, and $p = \\frac{1}{5}$. Therefore, the probability is calculated as:\n\\[ P(X = 4) = \\binom{7}{4} \\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)^4 \\left(1 - \\frac{1}{5}\\right)^{7-4} \\]",
      "z": -2.8311258324667317
    },
