      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Step 4: Calculate the binomial coefficient $\\binom{7}{4}$. This is the number of ways to choose 4 successes out of 7 trials, which is equal to $\\frac{7!}{4!(7-4)!} = \\frac{7 \\times 6 \\times 5}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = 35$.",
